                    <li class="translate-y-17.5 pb-20 opacity-0 transition duration-500 last:pb-0 data-[state=active]:translate-y-0 data-[state=active]:opacity-100 data-[state=past]:-translate-y-17.5"><h2 class="mb-2 text-5xl leading-[1.2] font-bold md:text-[80px]">The cover fades as the section enters</h2></li>
                    <li class="translate-y-17.5 pb-20 opacity-0 transition duration-500 last:pb-0 data-[state=active]:translate-y-0 data-[state=active]:opacity-100 data-[state=past]:-translate-y-17.5"><h2 class="mb-2 text-5xl leading-[1.2] font-bold md:text-[80px]">Each title steps in at mid screen</h2></li>
                    <li class="translate-y-17.5 pb-20 opacity-0 transition duration-500 last:pb-0 data-[state=active]:translate-y-0 data-[state=active]:opacity-100 data-[state=past]:-translate-y-17.5"><h2 class="mb-2 text-5xl leading-[1.2] font-bold md:text-[80px]">States are data attributes</h2></li>
                    <li class="translate-y-17.5 pb-20 opacity-0 transition duration-500 last:pb-0 data-[state=active]:translate-y-0 data-[state=active]:opacity-100 data-[state=past]:-translate-y-17.5"><h2 class="mb-2 text-5xl leading-[1.2] font-bold md:text-[80px]">Copy the section and its script</h2></li>
